        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Lontra-Marinha. Oshawott usa a concha em sua barriga como uma faca, bloqueando golpes e revidando com cortes rápidos. Dizem que aprendeu a afiá- la em pedras do leito dos rios ao observar humanos usando pedras de amolar.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 88% M / 12% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Oshawott pode evoluir para Dewott no nível 6 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Tail Whip</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Water Gun</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Soak, Water Sport</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Focus Energy</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Razor Shell</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Fury Cutter</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Water Pulse</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Aerial Ace, Revenge</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Aqua Jet</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Encore</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Aqua Tail</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Retaliate</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Swords Dance</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Hydro Pump</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aerial Ace, Air Slash, Aqua Tail, Attract, Avalanche, Blizzard, Chilling Water, Confide, Covet, Dig, Double Team, Encore, Endure, Facade, False Swipe, Fling, Flip Turn, Focus Energy, Frustration, Grass Knot, Hail, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hydro Pump, Ice Beam, Icy Wind, Iron Tail, Knock Off, Liquidation, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Rock Smash, Round, Scald, Sleep Talk, Snore, Snowscape, Substitute, Surf, Swagger, Swift, Swords Dance, Take Down, Taunt, Tera Blast, Thief, Toxic, Water Pledge, Water Pulse, Waterfall, Whirlpool, Work Up, X- Scissor</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Air Slash, Aqua Cutter, Assurance, Brine, Copycat, Detect, Knock Off, Night Slash, Sacred Sword, Screech, Trump Card</p>",
